  "body": "This has been bugging me for quite some time because my devs, once every few months, bring it to my attention that our Attr is both not Interoperable and not per specification. All browsers implement Attr as a Node as an EventTarget, but yet the spec implies otherwise. Could we ever even achieve the spec behavior without DESTROYING web compat? Should we update Attr to instead reflect the state of browsers?\n\nhttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-attr\n",
